    "Word lists for utils/contentFilter.js (C2, Google Play UGC policy).",
    "severe = never posted (422 CONTENT_BLOCKED): identity slurs, threats of violence, telling someone to hurt themselves.",
    "mild   = posted with the word masked as ****: general profanity and sexual abuse words (English, Hindi and Telugu, romanised).",
    "A word matches only as a WHOLE word after normalising (lower case, accents removed, leetspeak undone, letters drawn out",
    "like fuuuck collapsed, spaced-out letters like 'f u c k' joined). So class, assignment, Essex, cocktail and shitake never match.",
    "A trailing * allows the common endings in 'suffixes' (fuck* matches fucks, fucked, fucker, fucking, fuckin).",
    "Phrases (several words) also match when written together (killyourself) or with apostrophes (i'll kill you).",
    "Words with a normal everyday meaning are deliberately left out (chod = leave, kutta = dog, lund = a city, gudda = doll,",
